{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/17/itm_8f49c2aa347f31a5/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14375","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-08-18T00:16:01Z","content_hash":"89d8f9781545f6d5834964ce1098d72dbf9b51ce01dc603ecac9d4821b5b81a8","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv paper page with submission history and ancillary artifact","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14375"},{"label":"arXiv cs.AI recent list showing Mon, 17 Aug 2026 listing","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2608.14375"},{"label":"Legible Papers third-party summary","type":"url","url":"https://legiblepapers.com/papers/wrong-but-useful-trajectory-value-beyond-answer-correctness-in-multi-agent-messages"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.14375","fetched_at":"2026-08-18T00:16:01Z","fingerprint":"89d8f9781545f6d5834964ce1098d72dbf9b51ce01dc603ecac9d4821b5b81a8","id":"itm_8f49c2aa347f31a5","item_id":"itm_8f49c2aa347f31a5","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","reading_minutes":18,"score":92,"sort_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"paper","summary_zh":"这篇论文把多智能体消息的“答案是否正确”和“被下游 integrator 看到后是否改善最终推理”拆开，提出 DHD：缓存 5 条独立 agent 消息，再用 full-pool 与 leave-one-out replay 测 trajectory value。5 个数学/科学 benchmark、gpt-oss-120b 与 gemma-4-31B-it 上，错答消息在改变最终正确性的 in-pool LOO 事件中分别有 41.9%/45.3% 是 helpful；重复重放给出 p=0.0002，component masking 的 22 条 Gemma 诊断样本显示 wrong-helpful 更像来自 reasoning 而非 wrong answer。局限是 value 依赖消息池、integrator 和任务上下文，LOO 不隔离语义 token，真实长程工具 Agent 还需新的 outcome 定义。","tags":["multi-agent","trajectory-value","agent-evaluation","replay-attribution","DHD"],"title":"Wrong but Useful: Trajectory Value Beyond Answer Correctness in Multi-Agent Messages","title_hash":"91cbb332bdf59c0410a71c45f48ec7aab8c54546c4270da794323b155183390e","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14375"}
